--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The source code in this repository depends on, and the released model weights
were derived from, the following third-party work.

1. MONAI (Project MONAI)
   https://github.com/Project-MONAI/MONAI
   Apache License 2.0.
   The image encoder is MONAI's SwinUNETR. The encoder backbone was warm-started
   from MONAI's self-supervised Swin UNETR weights (Tang et al., CVPR 2022),
   released at
   https://github.com/Project-MONAI/MONAI-extra-test-data/releases/download/0.8.1/model_swinvit.pt

2. T5 (Google Research) via Hugging Face Transformers
   https://huggingface.co/t5-small
   Apache License 2.0.
   The text tower is initialised from the `t5-small` checkpoint.

3. Hugging Face Transformers
   https://github.com/huggingface/transformers
   Apache License 2.0.

4. TotalSegmentator (optional dependency)
   https://github.com/wasserth/TotalSegmentator
   Apache License 2.0. Note that the segmentation weights TotalSegmentator
   downloads carry their own terms, stated by that project.

